Carafe: the screen can take any size, not only one of the listed modes, and modes are emulated by default.
wine_nx_fit_screen sets the virtual screen to the size of the game's window; Wine then fits it into the
console's screen, keeping its proportions and centring it.
LGPL-2.1-or-later, as the file it changes.

